   "id": 639846,
   "is_answer_order_important": true,
   "stimulus_html": "<figure class=\"unnumbered\">\n<img src=\"exercises/media/fdfa89117a82a802.jpg\" alt=\"\">\n<figcaption>(credit: modification of work by Sonya M. Clegg and Albert B. Phillimore/<i>Phil. Trans. R. Soc. B</i>)</figcaption>\n</figure>",
   "stem_html": "<p>The image shows the distribution of marker genes in populations of birds in an island group in the Pacific.</p>\n<p>Island I is colonized by a group of birds from the nearest island. Make a prediction about the genetic markers of the population that would form in island I.</p>",
   "answers": [
    {
     "id": 1246903,
     "content_html": "It would be a mixture of the populations from islands G and H."
    },
    {
     "id": 1246902,
     "content_html": "It would be similar to the population of island H."
    },
    {
     "id": 1246901,
     "content_html": "It would be a mixture of the populations from islands A, G and H."
    },
    {
     "id": 1246900,
     "content_html": "It would be similar to the population of island G."
    }
